<template><div aria-live="polite"><Alert v-if="error" type="error" show-icon>{{error}}</Alert><Alert v-if="pending" type="warning" show-icon><p>本模块有一笔提交结果待确认。请回查原操作，不要重复创建请求。</p><p v-if="target" class="ui-meta">原业务路径：{{target}}</p><div class="ui-actions"><Button :loading="busy" @click="$emit('recover')">回查操作</Button><Button :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('retry')">原请求重试</Button><Button :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('abandon')">核实并关闭未提交请求</Button></div></Alert><p v-if="loading" class="ui-loading">正在读取当前资料…</p></div></template>
<script>export default {props:{error:String,pending:Boolean,busy:Boolean,loading:Boolean,target:String}};</script>
